# 二、Bing 前排页面 HTML 模板（核心）

下面这个结构，你可以直接当 **“Bing 标准答案页”** 用。

---

## 1️⃣ `<head>`（不要花哨）

```html
<title>What Is Gemini API? A Complete Guide for Developers</title>

<meta name="description"
      content="Gemini API is Google's AI interface for text, image, and multimodal generation. This guide explains what Gemini API is, how it works, and when to use it.">

<link rel="canonical" href="https://example.com/what-is-gemini-api">
```

**注意：**

* title = 问题 + 总结答案
* description = 可直接当搜索结果摘要

---

## 2️⃣ `<body>` 顶部（决定排名）

```html
<main>
  <h1>What Is Gemini API?</h1>

  <p>
    Gemini API is Google's official application programming interface that allows
    developers to integrate Gemini AI models into their applications.
    It supports text generation, image understanding, and multimodal reasoning.
  </p>

  <p>
    Developers commonly use Gemini API to build AI chatbots, content generation tools,
    and automation workflows. This page explains how Gemini API works,
    its core features, and typical use cases.
  </p>
```

📌 **重点**

* 第一段：一句话定义（Bing 超爱）
* 第二段：使用场景总结
* 完全不提你的网站、不提产品

---

## 3️⃣ 目录（强烈建议）

```html
<nav>
  <h2>Table of Contents</h2>
  <ul>
    <li><a href="#how-it-works">How Gemini API Works</a></li>
    <li><a href="#features">Key Features</a></li>
    <li><a href="#use-cases">Common Use Cases</a></li>
    <li><a href="#comparison">Gemini API vs Other AI APIs</a></li>
  </ul>
</nav>
```

👉 这是 **Bing 判断“这是文档”的重要信号**

---

## 4️⃣ 正文结构（核心内容区）

### 🔹 How it works

```html
<section id="how-it-works">
  <h2>How Gemini API Works</h2>

  <p>
    Gemini API processes user input by sending requests to Google's AI models.
    The models analyze text, images, or mixed inputs and return structured responses
    such as generated text or classifications.
  </p>
</section>
```

---

### 🔹 Features（用列表）

```html
<section id="features">
  <h2>Key Features of Gemini API</h2>

  <ul>
    <li>Text and multimodal generation</li>
    <li>Image understanding and reasoning</li>
    <li>Scalable API access for applications</li>
    <li>Integration with Google AI ecosystem</li>
  </ul>
</section>
```

---

### 🔹 Use cases（极重要）

```html
<section id="use-cases">
  <h2>Common Use Cases</h2>

  <p>Developers use Gemini API in several scenarios:</p>

  <ul>
    <li>Building AI chatbots for customer support</li>
    <li>Automating content creation</li>
    <li>Generating summaries from documents</li>
    <li>Analyzing images with contextual understanding</li>
  </ul>
</section>
```

👉 **Use cases 是 Bing 语义权重非常高的一块**

---

### 🔹 对比页（非常容易进前 5）

```html
<section id="comparison">
  <h2>Gemini API vs Other AI APIs</h2>

  <p>
    Compared with other AI APIs, Gemini API focuses on deep multimodal reasoning.
    Developers may choose different APIs depending on cost, performance, and features.
  </p>
</section>
```

---

## 5️⃣ FAQ（Bing 的“加速器”）

```html
<section>
  <h2>Frequently Asked Questions</h2>

  <h3>Is Gemini API free?</h3>
  <p>
    Gemini API availability and pricing depend on Google's official plans.
    Developers should review current documentation for details.
  </p>

  <h3>Who should use Gemini API?</h3>
  <p>
    Gemini API is suitable for developers building AI-powered applications
    that require text, image, or multimodal processing.
  </p>
</section>
```

👉 FAQ = Bing 的 **AI 引用候选区**

---

## 6️⃣ `<noscript>`（你之前问的关键）

```html
<noscript>
  <h2>Gemini API Overview</h2>
  <p>
    Gemini API is a developer interface for accessing Google's AI models.
    It enables text and multimodal generation for applications and services.
  </p>
</noscript>
```

📌 原则：

* 是正文摘要
* 不是重复全文
* 不要堆关键词

---

# 三、内容写作公式（照这个写就行）

### 🔑 每一节都遵守：

```
一句定义
↓
一句解释
↓
一句用途
```

### 🔑 每 300–400 字：

* 至少 1 次完整关键词
* 2–3 次语义变体

---

# 四、90% 网站在 Bing 翻车的原因

❌ 首页就是 hero banner
❌ 首屏只有 slogan
❌ 文本靠 JS 渲染
❌ 一个页面想排 5 个关键词
❌ 太像产品官网

